{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_54_109245095#2_277222571","relevance":3,"reason":"The passage directly explains that in 1984 the Party uses war and the Two Minutes Hate to unite Oceania's people against common enemies such as Eurasia and Goldstein. Although it appears to be a student/premium essay, it contains direct supporting evidence for hatred as a unifying tool.","learned":"The slogan 'War is Peace' and the Two Minutes Hate both direct citizens' hostility toward common enemies, making the crowd feel united against them."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q853","reason":"The common-enemy query has produced several grade-3 results about Goldstein, war, and citizens uniting through hatred; continue while it remains productive."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q853"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_23_332200854#4_753684823","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q853","rank":6,"snippet":"<cover>1984 by George Orwell, and Fidel Castro’s Government in Cuba Figure 1: A Handmaid views the bodies of criminals hanging on the Wall, with their crimes visible for all to see on a plaque on their chests (Wong). Bibliography Cancel reply \" , \"segment\": \"Immediately, the citizens blame Goldstein, the leader of the anti-Big Brother society called the Brotherhood. This renews their mutual hatred of Goldstein, the “primal traitor, [and] the earliest defiler of the party’s purity” (Orwell 12). The Party indoctrinates the citizens to believe that “all subsequent crimes against the Party… sprang directly out of [Goldstein’s] teaching” (Orwell 12), and consequently schedules Two Minute Hates (Orwell 2 Minutes of Hate) each day that feature videos of Goldstein speaking and the mobs of Party members expressing their deep hate of his teachings and their loyalty to the Party. In fact, the Hates work the citizens into such a nationalistic frenzy that “before the hate [s] had proceeded for thirty seconds, uncontrollable exclamations of rage were breaking out from half the people in the room” (Orwell 13). These overt forms of propaganda serve to unite the citizens against a common enemy </cover>and "}}
{"request":{"judgments":"26/50"}}
{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_23_332200854#4_753684823","relevance":3,"reason":"The passage directly explains that the Party makes citizens blame Goldstein, stages Two Minutes Hates where mobs express hatred and loyalty, and that these propaganda rituals unite citizens against a common enemy. It is near-duplicate evidence from the same blog but directly answers the information need.","learned":"By making Goldstein the common enemy and staging public hate rituals, the Party transforms mutual hatred into loyalty, patriotic frenzy, and unity among citizens."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q853","reason":"The common-enemy query is still producing direct grade-3 evidence about hatred uniting citizens in 1984; continue until the result list becomes less productive."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q853"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_54_109245095#1_277221339","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q853","rank":7,"snippet":"1377.000000 , \"headings\": \"Principles of Ingsoc Premium Essay Principles of Ingsoc Similar Documents Newspeak Metropolis and 1984 1984 to Today 1984 Orwell Ggfdgfdg The Hell of <cover>1984 \" , \"segment\": \"The main leader of this government was Big Brother. Newspeak was the official language of Oceania. INGSOC is English Socialism according to Newspeak language. There are three principles of INGSOC: War is Peace, Freedom is Slavery and Ignorance is Strength. War is peace is a belief that when a country is at war with some other country, the people and the states of the country get united to fight against their common enemy. In this novel, government used this principle to maintain peace in their country by being at war with Eurasia. This united the people of Oceania to fight with Eurasia. There are also some other examples of War is peace in this novel; during the two minute hate, when the face of Goldstein </cover>appeared on the screen and hate started, there were pictures of some Eurasian soldier and of the war.\" , \"start_char\": 561.000000 , \"title\":"}}
