{"latest_judgment":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_59_741757817#11_1687180122","relevance":3,"reason":"The passage directly describes the Two Minutes Hate as a daily ritual in which Oceania's citizens publicly show hatred toward Goldstein and then act collectively as the entire group breaks into a rhythmic Big Brother chant. This directly supports hatred as a tool that makes people act as one group, though it is framed through narrative analysis.","learned":"The Two Minutes Hate unifies citizens by requiring public hatred of Goldstein and transforming the crowd into a synchronized group chanting for Big Brother."},"action":{"op":"next","qid":"q862","reason":"This query found direct evidence of collective behavior during the Two Minutes Hate; continue to find more passages using the group chant or ritual as evidence of hatred uniting people."}}
{"request":{"op":"next","qid":"q862"},"response":{"docno":"msmarco_v2.1_doc_16_2310615795#5_2557120681","ok":true,"op":"next","qid":"q862","rank":2,"snippet":"reverence are more easily focused on an individual (if only a face on the hoardings and a voice on the telescreens) than an organisation. When Winston Smith is later arrested, O'Brien repeats that Big Brother will never die. When Smith asks if Big Brother exists, O'Brien describes him as \"the embodiment of the Party\" and says that he will exist as long as the Party exists. When Winston asks \"Does Big Brother exist the same way I do?\" ( meaning is Big Brother an actual human being), O'Brien replies \"You do not exist\" (meaning that Smith is now an unperson; an example of doublethink ). Cult of personality Big Brother is the subject of a cult of personality. A spontaneous ritual of devotion to \"BB\" is illustrated at the end of the compulsory <cover>Two Minutes Hate : At this moment the entire group of people broke into a deep, slow, rhythmic chant of 'B-B! ... </cover>B-B! ...\" , \"start_char\": 4151.000000 , \"title\": \"Big Brother (Nineteen Eighty-Four) - Wikipedia\" , \"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Big_Brother_%28Nineteen_Eighty-Four%29\" }"}}
